 .githooks/commit-msg            | 55 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 CONTRIBUTING/COMMIT-TRAILERS.md | 72 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/arifi-sync/arifi_sync.py  | 12 ++++++
 3 files changed, 139 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .githooks/commit-msg
